`@langchain/aws` keeps the Converse stream event as is, so on the `messageStop` chunk the reason is at `response_metadata.messageStop.stopReason` (raw chunk in the summary). One more link in the chain picks it up:

```suggestion
    metadata?.stopReason ??
    // @langchain/aws streams the Converse event as is: { messageStop: { stopReason } }
    (metadata?.messageStop as { stopReason?: unknown } | undefined)?.stopReason ??
```
